  fullText: Premou has taken our only surface gear, which should have enough\nwater
    to exit the caves.\nWe wrote a document with our story and what we know of this\ninvasion.\nMaybe
    one day some other advanced species might find it so that we\nare not forgotten.\nIf
    it happens, I hope that it serves as a warning to save others.
